# README stays current

`README.md` is the open-source front door. When you add, change, or remove a
user-facing feature, screen, tracking rule, setup step, or deploy assumption,
update `README.md` in the same change — especially **How it works** and
**Features**.

Help copy in `frontend/src/lib/help.ts` must stay consistent with that feature
list. Do not leave the README describing behaviour the code no longer has.
